Z||000000||The Fieromaster||07-17-2001||03:07 PM||||I want to get rid of my seatbelt... For looks and because after winter i will need it to be able to run at the local track!  So has anyone put a 4 point harness in their Fiero?  Where did you mount it to? Do you have pics?<P>Thanks!<P>------------------<BR>      <FONT COLOR="red">"Raced That, Wrecked Better"</FONT><BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif">        <BR><B>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000</B><BR><FONT COLOR="blue"><B>AIM: Fieromaster</B></FONT><BR><B><FONT COLOR="purple">1985 GT ~ Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="maroon">1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX ~ Maroon w/ Hella Balls!(GSX = AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000</FONT></B>||||reg||10
Z||000001||1FST2M6||07-17-2001||03:24 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/corbeau.jpg"> <P>been there.. fun for a week but QUICKLY looses it's novelty... you can't have a 4 pt and stock seats... unless you cut the seat and lay the belt through the neck area..  and seats range from $200 to $2000 ||||reg||1
